  "problem": "Marcus has two spinners. The first of them has three sections labeled $1,2,3,$ and the second has four sections labeled $0,2,4,8.$ The random variable $X$ represents the number obtained on a typical throw of the first spinner, and $Y$ is the number obtained on a typical throw of the second spinner. The first spinner is rolled $10$ times, and the second spinner is rolled $5$ times. What is the expected value of the sum of all outcomes?\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr> \n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$x$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$f(x)$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.2$</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"10\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr> \n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$y$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$f(y)$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.5$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\">$0.1$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n<p></p></th>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
